Official question catalogue
---------------------------
The German questions and answer options are reproduced verbatim from the
catalogue issued as Anlage 1 to the Einbürgerungstestverordnung (EinbTestV),
published in the Bundesgesetzblatt:

  https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/einbtestv/anlage_1.html

Official works published in the public interest are not protected by copyright
under §5 UrhG. The catalogue may therefore be used and redistributed by anyone
without permission. It is included here unmodified, and nothing in this
repository restricts its use. No licence is asserted over it, because no
licence is required.

Questions the catalogue's currency
----------------------------------
The catalogue was transcribed at the state recorded in the commit history that
introduced it. BAMF occasionally revises questions and adds new ones. Verify
against the current official catalogue before relying on this for an exam, and
open an issue if something is out of date.

